                "2": "The placement of Ketu may create extra marital affairs and create disturbance in the marital life. You will achieve a lot of foreign collaborative business opportunities which will give you financial gain and recognition in your professional field. Your job might make you handle multiple important projects and will finish your task with perseverance. You will be determined to do multiple tasks in one shot successfully which might give you huge success. You will do speculative business and might achieve growth in career. At times you might become lazy and will skip your work commitments. Your expectations with your significant other might be a barrier in your relationship.",
