                "6": "This placement is progressive and gives you the opportunity to spend quality time with family and friends. You should be attentive while making any investments and avoid giving money to others in a hurry. In terms of relationships, things may get stagnant and create a lack of interest in expressing love in the relationship. In terms of health, pay attention to your lifestyle and food habits. You will go through some ups and downs on the professional front, and you may face psychological issues from work stress and unknown fear.",
                "7": "You will have a harmonious married life and will support each other to fulfill your desires. But you might argue about petty things and spoil the mood. Ketu\u2019s presence will push you towards spirituality and materialism will slowly fade away. Everything will go well since you have confidence and a sensible attitude. If afflicted, your aggressive personality may present difficulties in relationships. You should try to arrange your finances in the long-term because your attention to money and finances might make you a greedy person. If afflicted, you will not be able to maintain your personal and professional life. You will lead life in solitude.",
                "8": "You will receive high cosmic powers and will be involved in mystical acts. Planetary positions will make you involve yourself in socializing and your reputation will expand the happiness of your family and children. You will be able to fulfill the responsibilities of your family and will change the environment harmoniously. Your longevity will be increased. If afflicted, there can be stress and hurdles which can bring challenges, and there will be ego clashes in relationships with family members. Professional rivalry can give you hurdles at the workplace. You may have chronic health and psychological issues stemming from unknown fear and loneliness.",
                "9": "The influence of the position of Ketu will give you much control and balance in your personal and professional life. You will be dedicated to spirituality and will follow strict rules and regulation of religious beliefs. Your creativity and innovative ideas will be magnified towards family and children. You will enjoy spending time with them and will have memorable moments. You may get settled abroad. If afflicted, it will affect your father\u2019s longevity and health. You will have fixated rules in life which will affect your personal relationships. It is advised to work at a slow pace to maintain stability in your productivity.",
                "10": "This placement can give you success in multiple businesses. You will acquire professional success but will have unexpected challenges. You will not be able to settle in life till the age of 48. You might bear family responsibility at an early age and will work hard to achieve happiness. If afflicted, you might lose important business clients and might face business losses. Your hard work will be in vain but do avoid professional stress as it can be reflected in your health through blood pressure. Your day-to-day activities will be quite rapid, which might give you physical and mental stress.",
                "11": "Embracing out-of-the-box thoughts will lead to unexpected and extraordinary moments of happiness. Ketu will gradually help you overcome pent-up emotions and you will achieve targets by planning and analyzing the task. As this placement might bestow you with lots of energy and aggression to do multiple tasks, it will be better for you to think before you speak. This placement will ensure a regular source of income, and this position will help you to get stability in terms of money and finances. At the same time, this position will give you anxiety to get your work done on time. You will react to the situation without thinking and face the repercussions.",
                "12": "Exciting relationships and personal growth are on the horizon. Embracing the equilibrium within oneself will unlock happiness and courage in all aspects of life. You will do long distance travel or will settle in abroad, which will make a great impact on your relationship. You will increase the warmth between you and your partner/spouse through your efforts. You will deal with any situation through analyzing and with inner strength. You will fulfil the desire for self-discovery and self-expression. If afflicted, your expectation with your significant other will be a barrier in your relationship. You will be a spendthrift and will face financial challenges."
