                "8": "You should try to arrange your finances in the long term. You will have interest in metaphysical realms and will achieve financial stability and savings in your career. You should be attentive while making any investments and avoid giving money to relatives. In terms of relationships, things will get stagnant as indicated by Ketu which will cause a lack of interest in expressing love in the relationship. Your aggressive personality may present difficulties in relationships. You will be highly intuitive and will have profound healing powers.",
                "9": "This placement will create disharmony with your spouse and family members, and in terms of health, do take care of your lifestyle and food habits. You will go through some ups and downs on the professional front, and you will face a lot of psychological issues related to work stress and unknown fear. Ketu will help you understand the value of emotional intelligence and help you to overcome challenges. There will be challenges in the professional field. You will be inclined towards spirituality and embark on pilgrimage. Ketu will cause challenges in terms of love and family relationships. Avoid conflicts and misunderstandings in personal relationships.",
