                "11": "Financial gain can be expected by the placement of Ketu which will bring the favor of luck and generate new and multiple sources of income. This placement will help you sanction the expected loan or ancestral property will aid financially. You will achieve a lot of foreign collaborations and indulge in other networking business opportunities which will give you financial gain and recognition in your professional field. You will have mental clarity and you will have clear thoughts to make important financial decisions. Your married life might face challenges and you will not acquire happiness through children.",
